agic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=A%20human%20boy%20who%20thinks%20he%27s%20a%20woman%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e5","era":null,"summary":"In a flashback, sixteen-year-old Alesha kills her first dragon with a spear and names herself Alesha, her grandmother's name, before the old khan and the horde.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death","mardu"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"major","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":483,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":37,"quote":"she pulled a spear from a dead man's back and plunged it into the beast's mouth, up into its brain.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=she%20pulled%20a%20spear,up%20into%20its%20brain.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Truth of Names","series":"Magic Story","authors":["James Wyatt"],"date":"2015-01-28","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=she%20pulled%20a%20spear,up%20into%20its%20brain.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Truth of Names\" by James Wyatt. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jan 2015."}},{"id":"truth-names-2015-01-28-e6","era":null,"summary":"In the flashback, the old khan and horde shout Alesha's name without hesitation.","participants":["alesha-who-smiles-at-death","mardu"],"location":"the-canyon","importance":"major","page":"stories/truth-names-2015-01-28","order":483,"story_date":"2015-01-28","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":43,"quote":"And the whole gathered horde shouted \"Alesha!\" in reply.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/truth-names-2015-01-28#:~:text=And%20the%20whole%20gathered,shouted%20%22Al